  <name>Cove Waterfront District - Study Area (Deerfield Beach)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Cove Waterfront District - Study Area.

STATUS: Provided/official study-area boundary (extracted verbatim from the supplied KMZ '01__Cove_Waterfront_District_Study_Area.kmz'). This supersedes the earlier interpretive polygon.

EXTENT: ~1,040 acres / 1.63 sq mi. Bounded by US-1/Federal Highway (W) and the Intracoastal/canal waterfront (E), extending from a southern edge near the Lighthouse Point transition north past Hillsboro Blvd to the north waterfront.

For planning / discussion use. Geometry is authoritative as supplied; verify against the city's official GIS if used for regulatory purposes.]]></description>
